Rents.text:
Rents increased primarily as a result of the following:

• $6.1 million increase due to the consolidation of 3025 JFK Venture and 3151 Market Street Venture in the fourth quarter of 2025;

• $0.5 million increase related to 155 King of Prussia Road, Radnor, PA and 250 King of Prussia Road, Radnor, PA, which were both Recently Completed/Acquired Properties in 2025, but stabilized in the first quarter of 2026 and the second quarter of 2026, respectively;

• $3.1 million increase due to the opening of the hotel in Radnor, Pennsylvania in the second quarter of 2026; and

• Partially offset by $7.8 million decrease due to the sale of Four Barton Skyway, Austin, TX in the second quarter of 2025, the sale of Six Tower Bridge, Conshohocken, PA in the second quarter of 2026, and the sales of 500 North Gulph Road, King of Prussia, PA, 405 Colorado, Austin, TX, and 8260 Greensboro Drive and 1676 International Drive, McLean, VA in the third quarter of 2026.
